flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[User Enters Credentials]
    B --> C{Validate Input}
    C -->|Invalid| D[Show Error Message]
    D --> B
    C -->|Valid| E[Send Login Request]
    E --> F{Check Credentials}
    F -->|Invalid| G[Return Error]
    G --> D
    F -->|Valid| H[Generate JWT Token]
    H --> I[Store Token & User Data]
    I --> J[Redirect to Dashboard]
    J --> K[End]
    
    style A fill:#90caf9
    style K fill:#90caf9
    style F fill:#ffcc80
    style C fill:#ffcc80